<%- include('partials/head') %><main id="main" class="wrap section prose"><p class="eyebrow">A FEW SWEET ANSWERS</p><h1>Good things to know.</h1><% [['How do I order?','Choose a cake, select its options and add it to your bag. Submit your celebration details. Your enquiry is saved first, then you can continue on WhatsApp.'],['Is my order confirmed when I submit?','No. We confirm availability, design, delivery, final price and payment with you before accepting an order.'],['Can I personalise a cake?','Yes—send a custom enquiry with your colours, theme and ideas. We will confirm what is possible.'],['What about eggless cakes or allergies?','Select your preference where available and mention all allergies in your enquiry. Ask us to confirm ingredients before you order.'],['Where do you deliver?',site.deliveryText],['Can I order for today?','Availability depends on the cake and our schedule. Tell us your date and contact us to confirm.']].forEach(([q,a])=>{ %><details><summary><%= q %></summary><p><%= a %></p></details><% }) %></main><%- include('partials/footer') %>
